{title: The Holy Ghost that Jesus is giving away}

{comment: Chorus}
It’s for me, and it’s for you
It’s for your children and their children too
It does something that nothing else can do
In acts the second chapter, you can read it for yourself
You don’t have to ask anybody else
About the Holy Ghost that Jesus is giving away

{comment: Verse 1}
I got something that turned me around
I got something that never lets me down
I got something that keeps me everyday
It's like fire shut up in my bones
And it's sweeter than the honey in the comb
It's the Holy Ghost that Jesus is giving away.

{comment: Verse 2}
It's like a strong rushing mighty wind
Yes it does help keep me from sin
I got something that showers me when I pray
I got something that guide my feet
It makes me love all I meet
It's the Holy Ghost that Jesus is giving away.
